{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyMzYzMA==","is_bot":false,"login":"rparcus","name":"Robert Parcus"},"body":"## Overview\n\nImplement local model support via Ollama, enabling self-hosted LLM capabilities with optimized performance.\n\n## Core Features\n- Ollama integration\n- Local model management\n- Model download and caching\n- Performance optimization\n- Resource management\n\n## Technical Details\n- Implement Ollama client\n- Add model management system\n- Set up caching mechanisms\n- Implement resource controls\n- Add performance monitoring\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Implement Ollama API client\n- [ ] Add model management functionality\n- [ ] Create caching system for models\n- [ ] Implement resource usage controls\n- [ ] Add performance monitoring\n- [ ] Include documentation and examples\n- [ ] Add integration tests\n\n## Budget: $400","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc6iyeiV","author":{"login":"BHARATJHAWAR52"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @rparcus \nI am interested in contributing to this project where we can run local models via Ollama.\nI have an experience in building models, and analyzing data, for various purposes. Also, I know about integrating Ollama with different projects. ","createdAt":"2025-03-17T23:00:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-2731141269","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc7H4FBY","author":{"login":"1914Jegx"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #96\n\nImplementation plan:\n1. Implement Lux.LLM.Ollama stack (client, resource pool, model manager, supervisor) with telemetry and configuration hooks.\n2. Wire runtime/application config and env vars so Ollama defaults work locally and in tests.\n3. Add documentation plus unit/integration coverage validating model caching, auto-pull, and request flow.","createdAt":"2025-09-30T18:39:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-3353366616","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc7IGlsD","author":{"login":"IshGadol"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi team,\n\nI’d like to take on this bounty and implement Ollama support for Lux. My plan is straightforward:\n\n- Build a dedicated Ollama provider that plugs into Lux’s existing LLM integration layer.\n- Add an HTTP client for Ollama’s API (/api/chat, /api/generate, /api/list, /api/pull, /api/show, /api/delete, etc.).\n- Provide model management helpers (list, pull, show, delete) with light caching so models are pulled on-demand and tracked.\n- Map Lux runtime options to Ollama’s resource controls (num_ctx, temperature, top_p, keep_alive, etc.).\n- Support both streaming and non-streaming responses, plus JSON/Schema outputs using Ollama’s format parameter.\n- Emit performance telemetry (load duration, tokens/sec, eval times) so metrics can feed into Lux’s monitoring.\n- Ship a minimal working example (Beam) and documentation showing setup, config (OLLAMA_BASE_URL, OLLAMA_MODEL, etc.), and usage.\n- Add tests: unit tests with mocked responses, and optional integration tests gated on a local Ollama install.\n\nA couple of quick clarifications to align with your expectations:\n- Should the default interface be /api/chat, or do you also want /api/generate supported in v1?\n- Are embeddings (/api/embeddings) in scope, or should I focus only on chat/generate for now?\n- Any preference on the default model (e.g., llama3.2:latest) for the demo/example Beam?\n\nIf this scope looks good to you, I’ll get started. Thanks for putting up the bounty—I’m confident I can deliver this cleanly and keep it aligned with Lux’s direction.\n\n—David","createdAt":"2025-10-01T16:22:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-3357170435","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc7oisZt","author":{"login":"lmee"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I went through \"Local Model Support via Ollama $400\" plus the discussion thread and mapped the failing path.\n\nProblem I see: Implement local model support via Ollama, enabling self-hosted LLM capabilities with optimized performance.\nRoot-cause hypothesis: a stale-state race between optimistic updates and confirmed data.\nFirst patch plan: trace policy creation gating and billing-plan conditions, patch the branch creating invalid records, and add tests for control/annual plan combinations.\nIf this aligns with maintainer expectations, I will post repro evidence first and then open the scoped patch.","createdAt":"2026-02-14T08:31:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-3901408877","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc7p5XY6","author":{"login":"sushi-levanter"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi! I've submitted PR #374 implementing Ollama LLM provider support for local models. Includes a full OllamaProvider module with model management, chat/generate/embeddings APIs, streaming support, and comprehensive tests. Happy to iterate based on feedback.","createdAt":"2026-02-19T01:16:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-3924129338","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc7p5zjU","author":{"login":"sushi-levanter"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi! I've submitted PR #374 for Ollama LLM provider support. Apologies for not commenting first per the bounty guidelines. The implementation includes full Ollama API integration with model management, streaming, embeddings support, and comprehensive tests. Open to feedback and scope discussion.","createdAt":"2026-02-19T02:01:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-3924244692","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCRS50w","author":{"login":"BigPolarBear"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #96\n\nSubmitted PR: https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/pull/564\n\nWhat changed:\n- Added Lux.LLM.Ollama for local chat calls against Ollama /api/chat.\n- Added model management for list/show/pull/delete/ensure plus TTL cache.\n- Added resource-control planning and performance summaries for local model monitoring.\n- Verified with mix format, git diff --check, MIX_ENV=prod mix compile, and a core smoke check.\n\nNote: scoped unit tests are currently blocked by the existing Credo compile failure on Elixir 1.19.5 before these tests run.","createdAt":"2026-05-14T03:50:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4447320531","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCaSeGg","author":{"login":"laolaoqi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi, I'd like to work on Local Model Support via Ollama. I have experience with Ollama API and local LLM deployment.\n\nMy approach:\n- Integrate Ollama API as a Lux LLM provider\n- Support model listing, chat completion, and embeddings\n- Configurable model parameters (temperature, top_p, etc.)\n- Streaming response support\n- Docker Compose for local dev setup with Ollama\n\nTimeline: 3-4 days after scope discussion.\n\nPayment wallet: 0xdFc476D7Bb10230B26500eEE24e300B26d253561","createdAt":"2026-05-15T03:55:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4456750618","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABCatYnw","author":{"login":"laolaoqi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"?? Interested in Local Model Support via Ollama () bounty. Experience deploying Ollama, model quantization, and integrating local LLMs into applications. Payment: 0xdFc476D7Bb10230B26500eEE24e300B26d253561","createdAt":"2026-05-15T05:38:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4457191583","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABD-LwYQ","author":{"login":"JirA44"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi! I'd like to work on this Ollama integration. I'll implement it following the existing OpenAI/Anthropic LLM pattern with the OpenAI-compatible endpoint at /v1/chat/completions. Should have a PR ready shortly.","createdAt":"2026-05-28T06:54:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4561498209","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABEeGeyA","author":{"login":"theherrovn-sys"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to claim this. I have a physical NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin (128GB, ARM64 + CUDA) which can run Ollama with large models (70B+) natively — perfect for testing the Ollama API client with real LLM workloads.\n\nI'll implement the full Ollama API surface, model management with LRU caching, resource monitoring (GPU memory pressure tracking on real CUDA hardware), and graceful error handling.\n\nCan deliver a working PR within 7 days.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T17:30:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4594966216","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABEeG73w","author":{"login":"theherrovn-sys"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I have a Jetson AGX Orin (128GB, ARM64+CUDA) - can run Ollama 70B models on real hardware for testing. Full API surface, model caching, GPU memory monitoring. PR in 7 days.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T17:31:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4594973663","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABEnhTQQ","author":{"login":"JamesJi79"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'll implement Ollama integration. Starting work on the Ollama API client + model management system.","createdAt":"2026-06-02T17:03:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4604842817","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABGDRbOg","author":{"login":"yogeshkampalliwar"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@rparcus I'd like to work on this bounty. I recently completed Issue #82 Hyperliquid (PR #719) and Issue #79 PancakeSwap (PR #720). I'm familiar with the Lux prism architecture and can implement Ollama local model support following the same patterns. Can you officially assign this to me?","createdAt":"2026-06-14T07:30:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4701051706","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABHMkIag","author":{"login":"zhaog100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I am interested in implementing this bounty. I have extensive experience with Elixir/OTP and relevant domain expertise. I will join the Discord dev-chat to discuss scope and timeline. Please assign this bounty to me.","createdAt":"2026-06-23T09:46:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4777904234","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABHWRxIQ","author":{"login":"diligently-tech"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Implemented this in PR #830: https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/pull/830\n\nThe contribution adds:\n\n- `Lux.LLM.Ollama` for local Ollama chat completions\n- Lux Prism/Beam/Lens tool support through Ollama tools\n- local model management helpers for listing, checking, pulling, showing, loading, and unloading models\n- caching-aware `ensure_model/2` and optional `auto_pull`\n- runtime resource controls such as `num_ctx`, `num_thread`, `num_gpu`, `max_tokens`, and `keep_alive`\n- performance metadata from Ollama timing/token counters\n- unit tests with `Req.Test`\n- an Ollama guide linked from the docs\n\nI could not run the Elixir test suite in this environment because Elixir/Mix were unavailable, but the PR includes focused unit coverage and follows the existing OpenAI / TogetherAI provider shape.\n\nFor bounty payout, please confirm supported payment methods. The contributor can receive compliant payments through a China-based account; no crypto/Gas/deposit/prepayment flow is required from the contributor side.","createdAt":"2026-06-24T10:05:06Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4788089121","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDONlDJhc8AAAABIVW-0Q","author":{"login":"bambooshadow-studio"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #96\n\nSubmitted PR: https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/pull/898\n\nImplements Ollama local model provider with full Lux.LLM behaviour compliance.","createdAt":"2026-07-01T11:48:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96#issuecomment-4854234833","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2025-02-25T11:06:09Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDONlDJhc8AAAAB2iNfMA","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"},{"id":"LA_kwDONlDJhc8AAAAB6PoGQw","name":"bounty","description":"","color":"395808"},{"id":"LA_kwDONlDJhc8AAAAB6P9AOQ","name":"llm","description":"Issues related to LLM integrations and features","color":"0366d6"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"Local Model Support via Ollama $400","updatedAt":"2026-07-01T11:48:42Z","url":"https://github.com/Spectral-Finance/lux/issues/96"}
